=== frame
<frame>
<project title="The Clear Hours" language="en">
<premise>In a seaside town, Mary waits for Paul, who left without a word. An unsigned letter revives their story.</premise>
</project>
<layers>
<layer handle="L1" kind="manuscript" name="Manuscript">The text of the novel.</layer>
<layer handle="L2" kind="notes" name="Characters">Who appears in the scene, and what we learn about each.</layer>
<layer handle="L3" kind="notes" name="Plot">What the scene moves forward.</layer>
</layers>
<beats>
<beat title="The Wait">
<description>Mary waits for a sign from Paul. The days go by at the harbor café, between the rain and the regulars, and each letter that does not come weighs a little more. The days go by at the harbor café, between the rain and the regulars, and each letter that does not come weighs a little more. The days go by at the harbor café, between the rain and the regulars, and each letter that does not come weighs a little more. The days go by at the harbor café, between the rain and the regulars, and each letter that does not come weighs a little more. The days go by at the harbor café, between the rain and the regulars, and each letter that does not come weighs a little more. The days go by at the harbor café, between the rain and the regulars, and each letter that does not come weighs a little more. The days go by at the harbor café, between the rain and the regulars, and each letter that does not come weighs a little more. The days go by at the harbor café, between the rain and the regulars, and each letter that does not come weighs a little more. The days go by at the harbor café, between the rain and the regulars, and each letter that does not come weighs a little more. The days go by at the harbor café, between the rain and the regulars, and each letter that does not come weighs a little more. The days go by at the harbor café, between the rain and the regulars, and each letter that does not come weighs a little more. The days go by at the harbor café, between the rain and the regulars, and each letter that does not come weighs a little more.</description>
<scene handle="S1" title="Opening">Mary waits in the rain.</scene>
